Every name lookup compares case exactly

```
{#Plan}
# Plan

See </#Plan> and </#plan>.
.
<section id="Plan">
  <h1>Plan</h1>
  <p>See <a href="#Plan">Plan</a> and &lt;/#plan&gt;.</p>
</section>
```

